                                                "sense_id": "ec29c256-c6f2-3400-88c1-182a24b9c299",
                                                "text": "Pahlavi literature traditionally defines the writings of the Zoroastrians in the Middle Persian language and Book Pahlavi script which were compiled in the 9th and the 10th centuries CE."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab8863e6-e71a-3142-9355-16dc4a3d4834",
